			"notes": "# Changelog\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- **TempWaypoint**: fix rare concurrentmodificationexception\n\n### New Features\n\n- **SafariStats**: Safari completion tracker\n- **Area Texture Overrides**: Dynamic sprite/model rerouting based on active area\n- **ATO**: Cold Nether + Dark End (bundled resources) \n\n### Ref\n\n- Add Rarity enum\n- **GameChat**: Use party status for channel internally\n- **FaColors**: Ensure identity is preserved when skipping tooltip lines\n- **NpcDialogue**: Support new clickevent prompts + fix typo in class name\n- **NpcLocation**: Hadle separately from temp + simplify waypoint style\n- **TempWaypoint**: Cache label formatting\n- **Safeguard**: Stay active in dungeon if screen any is open\n- Use Mort dialogue for active run status\n- Add Threads utility\n\n### Misc\n\n- Remove unused assets"
		},
