			"notes": "# Changelog\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- **TimerDisplay**: Add missing alpha to timer segment + generalize name\n- **AlertEditScreen**: String matching mode not initialized\n\n### New Features\n\n- Modify nether sky by tinting atmospheric fog\n- **EqDisplay**: Option to move and show tooltip + support new types\n- Sb 0.27\n- **ItemPrice**: Option to include lbin in tooltip\n- **ChatAlert**: Add search bar\n- Reorder selected resource packs\n\n### Ref\n\n- **TransLava**: Targeted refresh to avoid issues with sodium during disconnects\n- **EqTextures**: Persist tooltip and item model\n- **EqDisplay**: Trigger scan also from stats and ld, detect unequip\n- **NpcDialogue**: Only handle confirmations\n- Separate resource category\n- **ResourceHandler**: Remove depreceated api\n- **GameMode**: Ensure server check doesnt happen when serverdata is null\n- **CollectionTracker**: Combat vague new recipe titles by saving active state during scan\n- Only try locraw if server is verified\n- Use relative positioning for hud elements\n\n### Build\n\n- Commit wrapper.jar + update ignore"
		},
